<title>ITALY: Italian petroleum consumption down 5.7 pct in Dec.</title>
<headline>Italian petroleum consumption down 5.7 pct in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian consumption of refined oil products fell 5.7 percent to 8.3 million tonnes in December, according to data from trade group Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It added that in the whole of 1996, consumption of petroleum products fell 2.0 percent to 94.265 million tonnes compared to 96.148 million tonnes.</p>
<p>FOR DECEMBER 1996 VS DECEMBER 1995</p>
<p>Category			1996 (000 tonnes) Chg vs 1995 </p>
<p>Total				  8.308	    - 5.7 pct </p>
<p>Total gasoline		     1.551	    + 3.4 pct </p>
<p>Total gasoil			 2.240	    - 3.7 pct</p>
<p>FOR 1996 YEAR VS 1995 YEAR</p>
<p>Category			1996 (000 tonnes) Chg vs 1995</p>
<p>Total				 94.265	    - 2.0 pct</p>
<p>Total gasoline		    17.674	    + 1.1 pct </p>
<p>Total gasoil			22.631	    - 1.7 pct</p>
</text>
